<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F2.sf7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(g)</span> </span><span id="S3.F2.sf7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Dark Humor: Yes
<br class="ltx_break">Target: Disability
<br class="ltx_break">Intensity: 2</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_4">
