<div id="S4.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS5.p2.1" class="ltx_p">All experiments were conducted on a server equipped with Intel(R) Xeon(R) Silver 4316 CPU @ 2.30GHz, 4× NVIDIA A16 GPUs (each with 16 GB VRAM), running CUDA 12.8 and driver version 570.133.07. The training utilized PyTorch with GPU acceleration, and computations were distributed using a single GPU unless specified otherwise.</p>
</div>
